OL,3,GNEWSARugby league fans in Wakefield for
OL,4,Abus parade
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of rugby league fans turned
OL,7,Fout to watch an open-top bus parade,
OL,8,Fafter Wakefield Trinity were crowned
OL,9,FSuper League champions.
OL,11,FTrinity beat Warrington Wolves 23-10 in
OL,12,FSaturday's Grand Final at Old Trafford
OL,13,F- their first title win since 1968,
OL,14,Flong before Super League was
OL,15,Festablished.
OL,17,FTo celebrate the victory, two buses,
OL,18,Fcarrying players and staff, travelled
OL,19,Ffrom the club's ground at Belle Vue to
OL,20,FWakefield Town Hall for a civic
OL,21,Freception.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
